{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Alley Cats Idle</strong>\u2014a laid-back game all about building your very own bustling alley full of charming cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a curious stray or two, then sit back as your alley fills with a colorful cast of feline personalities. Each cat you collect brings its own style, antics, and upgrades to your growing urban hideaway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect Cats</strong> \u2013 Unlock a wide variety of cats, from scrappy alley prowlers to fluffy cuddlebugs, each with unique looks and personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/876f23f8010fb486a51e00ea7e850024.poster.avif?t=1759938051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/876f23f8010fb486a51e00ea7e850024.webm?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/876f23f8010fb486a51e00ea7e850024.mp4?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade Your Alley</strong> \u2013 Transform a quiet backstreet into a thriving cat paradise with cozy boxes, scratching posts, and hidden nooks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/233c21e186bf5f1a267e33ec24afd5ae.poster.avif?t=1759938051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/233c21e186bf5f1a267e33ec24afd5ae.webm?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/233c21e186bf5f1a267e33ec24afd5ae.mp4?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a <strong>Idle &amp; Relax</strong> \u2013 Earn rewards even while you\u2019re away\u2014your cats never stop exploring, playing, and napping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/ed36901539e9081d23940c85079d804f.poster.avif?t=1759938051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/ed36901539e9081d23940c85079d804f.webm?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/ed36901539e9081d23940c85079d804f.mp4?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming Style</strong> \u2013 Relax with cozy visuals and a lighthearted atmosphere perfect for cat lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/fa9bc78ff7ff221818e2783beeb92c33.poster.avif?t=1759938051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/fa9bc78ff7ff221818e2783beeb92c33.webm?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/extras/fa9bc78ff7ff221818e2783beeb92c33.mp4?t=1759938051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player who enjoys checking in from time to time or someone who loves unlocking every collectible, <i>Alley Cats Idle</i> is a relaxing, feel-good experience about friendship, discovery, and of course\u2026 cats.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081530?t=1759938051","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/518e12a0b798cd131d8144ab02f931776218bee8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759938051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/202043298f3d3039e8c5533c4074be836137923d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759938051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081530/202043298f3d3039e8c5533c4074be836137923d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759938051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Alley Cats Idle</strong>\u2014a laid-back game all about building your very own bustling alley full of charming cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a curious stray or two, then sit back as your alley fills with a colorful cast of feline personalities. Each cat you collect brings its own style, antics, and upgrades to your growing urban hideaway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect Cats</strong> \u2013 Unlock a wide variety of cats, from scrappy alley prowlers to fluffy cuddlebugs, each with unique looks and personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p